      "body": "<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: summarize by coderabbit.ai -->\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n<a href=\"https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/hasansyed-proofline/bench-coderabbit/pull/1?scope=ghh_OusAJGA4HG8ljoOV0wJvVx8NmnZIjc2DdjmxOu0xZWA&amp;cs_source=review_comment\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-buttons-v1/explain-change.svg\" alt=\"Explain Change \u2192\" height=\"32\"></picture></a>\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- walkthrough_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Walkthrough</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- coderabbit_walkthrough_overview_removed -->\n\n**Changes: History Pagination**\n\n|Layer / File(s)|Summary|\n|:---|:---|\n|**Scheduled timestamp cursor** <br> `reports.py`|`history` filters by `scheduled_at`, orders by `scheduled_at` and `id`, and uses the last row\u2019s `scheduled_at` as the next cursor.|\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<!-- walkthrough_end -->\n<!-- change_assessment_start -->\n<!-- change_assessment_commit:\"b42257746fa78caad922340082a2a27ed00cdeb8\" -->\n<!-- change_assessment_priority:{\"version\":1,\"urgency\":\"p2\",\"manual\":false} -->\n**Change:** Feature\n<!-- change_assessment_end -->\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Merge Risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-normal-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Moderate</strong> \u00b7 up to <code>b4225</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- final_review_risk_start -->\n<!-- final_review_risk_label\n**Merge Risk:** **\ud83d\udfe1 Moderate** \u00b7 up to `b4225`\n-->\n<!-- final_review_risk_coverage:{\"sourceCommitId\":\"b42257746fa78caad922340082a2a27ed00cdeb8\",\"coveredCommitId\":\"b42257746fa78caad922340082a2a27ed00cdeb8\",\"kind\":\"reviewed\"} -->\n\nReport history pagination can silently skip deliveries that share a scheduled second at a page boundary. Users paging through history may miss entries without any error. Fix the cursor and filter to use the (scheduled_at, id) pair before merging.\n<!-- final_review_risk_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Architecture risk:</strong> <strong><picture><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-comment-icons-v1/risk-low-16.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\"></picture> Low</strong> \u00b7 up to <code>b4225</code></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<!-- architecture_review_start -->\n<!-- architecture_review_label\n### Architecture Summary\n\n**Architecture risk:** **\ud83d\udd35 Low** \u00b7 up to `b4225`\n-->\n\nThe change affects 1 system.\n\n**Changed systems:** `reports.py`\n\n**Architecture concerns**\nNo architecture-level concerns identified.\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Review details</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n**Systems and components**\n- _observed_ \u2014 reports.py (service) was modified; 1 changed file maps to changed impact.\n\n**Before / after behavior**\n- _observed_ \u2014 Modified behavior in reports.py: `history` now filters with `scheduled_at < cursor` instead of `id < cursor`, orders results by `scheduled_at DESC, id DESC` instead of `id DESC`, and uses the last returned row\u2019s `scheduled_at` as the next cursor instead of its ID.\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- architecture_review_end -->\n\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</details>\n<!-- finishing_touch_checkbox_start -->\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Finishing Touches</strong></summary>\n<dl>\n<dd>\n<br>\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>Generate 